Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.36,0:00:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is a series of\Nnever-ending initiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.31,0:00:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Being part of the Whispers\Nmeans being obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.09,0:00:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You always have to know\Nto follow the rules
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.38,0:00:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,and to listen no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.60,0:00:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the true essence\Nof this sisterhood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,is being open to everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.94,0:01:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No fear, no secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.74,0:01:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And as the final step,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.02,0:01:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to undress.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.49,0:01:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.09,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your blindfold off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your clothes off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.34,0:01:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In silence, we rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.06,0:01:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the saying that\Nstrengthens the Whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.84,0:02:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.45,0:02:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,[background chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.30,0:02:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I late?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.65,0:02:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just in time.\NHe just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.23,0:03:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.44,0:03:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor Landico,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,the man who can smell fear\Nlike blood in a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.69,0:03:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not just a terror,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.53,0:03:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,he's like an executioner\Nin the middle of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Martinez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, he's absent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.90,0:03:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cassidy Del Mundo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.52,0:03:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about the case\NPeople vs. Chua.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The facts, the issue, the ruling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.13,0:04:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,People vs. Chua
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.21,0:04:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,is a 2004 Supreme Court case
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,involving a man convicted of\Nraping his 14 year-old daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The case examined the\Ncredibility of the child victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.63,0:04:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The sufficiency of circumstantial evidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.13,0:04:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and the defense's claim of fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.87,0:04:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What made this case significant
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,is that the court emphasized
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,how victims of abuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.93,0:04:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,especially minors,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,often remain silent for long periods
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,due to fear, shame, or manipulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence does not mean consent.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.40,0:04:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Delay does not mean fabrication.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.30,0:04:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The court said
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.46,0:04:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,“A rape victim's testimony, if credible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,does not need corroboration.”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.29,0:04:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The law doesn't expect a\Nchild to remember every detail
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,after enduring such trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.84,0:04:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a reminder that abuse\Nis not always loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.65,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes it hides in silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,In locked doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In homes that look\Nnormal from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.26,0:05:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.27,0:05:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As Del Mundo said,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.26,0:05:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,this case was significant because
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,of the abuse that took\Nplace behind closed doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.38,0:05:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're really my favorite\Namong all our members.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.58,0:05:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Because, you know, the others\Nare so cheap and tacky!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.03,0:05:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Right? You noticed that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.21,0:05:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you know about\NFranco's fraternity, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Our partner frat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.26,0:05:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.32,0:05:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. Hi, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.61,0:05:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, you know\NCassidy, right babe?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.51,0:05:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you, Cassidy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.03,0:06:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, babe,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.33,0:06:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,don't forget about\Nthe party this Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.87,0:06:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Of course, babe.\N- Are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.43,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She's my new girlie, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,See you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.85,0:06:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, babe, I'll head out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:29.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.84,0:06:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Party? This Saturday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really into parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're with me, you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you follow the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.70,0:06:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.55,0:06:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And we are the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.28,0:07:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, girl! Are you enjoying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.89,0:07:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sandra, you look pretty tonight!\N- Thanks, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.60,0:07:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah!\N- Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.86,0:08:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,This is life, Cass...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.08,0:08:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.95,0:08:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wet...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.16,0:08:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Daring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't explore,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.71,0:08:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you won't learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll forever be a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Five seconds! No malice!\N- Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.47,0:08:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Five seconds! No malice!\N- Have fun! Dance!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.73,0:08:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dance. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:09:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[crowd shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.64,0:09:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[crowd shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you having fun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.12,0:09:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[crowd shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.91,0:09:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[crowd shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.39,0:10:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[crowd shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[crowd shouting]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.50,0:10:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You want some show?\NI'll give you a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.55,0:13:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like you saw a ghost?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just not used to partying.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.73,0:13:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.23,0:13:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to get used\Nto things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.08,0:13:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.92,0:14:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you prepared for our\Nsecond round of recitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.30,0:14:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, for our first one,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Carla Rivera.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about the People v. Santiago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,The case involving abuse,\Nand LGBTQ rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.66,0:14:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the ruling?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.04,0:14:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhm...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.50,0:14:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.09,0:14:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Remain standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.86,0:14:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Selene Hernandez.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.91,0:15:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,In People vs Santiago, the court\Nruled in favor of the victim,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.58,0:15:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,emphasizing that abuse,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,regardless of gender identity\Nor sexual orientation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.08,0:15:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,must be prosecuted\Nwith equal weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.79,0:15:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The case set precedent
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.54,0:15:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,for protecting LGBTQ\Nindividuals under the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.00,0:15:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Reinforcing that discrimination\Nshould not interfere with justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.71,0:15:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. And why was\Nthis case significant?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.54,0:15:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it challenged biases\Nin the justice system.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.59,0:15:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It reaffirmed that LGBTQ individuals
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.10,0:15:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,deserve the same legal\Nprotection as anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.85,0:15:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Preventing abusers from using\Nsocietal prejudice as a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, Ms. Hernandez,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.37,0:15:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,if I was to give you a score of one,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.57,0:15:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,and Ms. Rivera a five,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.70,0:15:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,would that be just?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:10.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Because fairness doesn't mean\Ntreating everyone the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.85,0:16:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It means recognizing effort\Nand responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.40,0:16:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I studied. I prepared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the time to understand\Nthe case because it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.03,0:16:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like justice matters\Nin the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,If someone fails to meet the standard,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.98,0:16:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,they should be held accountable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.70,0:16:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how the law works.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.42,0:16:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said, Hernandez.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.38,0:16:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a seat.\NYou get a grade of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And for you, Rivera, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.33,0:16:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So now, you understand how\Nthe law works. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.34,0:16:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys better study\Nnext time, alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit. Poor Carla.\NSelene didn't even hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she had a point,\Nbut still, it's brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.42,0:17:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Selene really doesn't\Nspare anyone, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.45,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Typical. She's pretty and smart,\Nbut damn, she's a devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.41,0:17:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd think she's nice, but nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.62,0:17:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,She's all about justice and\Naccountability like she's some saint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.80,0:17:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful. Someone might\Nhear you and get you in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.33,0:23:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.96,0:23:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,or do you want to be me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.30,0:24:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.35,0:24:37.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.73,0:24:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.48,0:24:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this. So funny, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.56,0:24:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Sandra,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.27,0:24:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,do you remember what\Nyou did at the party?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.29,0:25:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.62,0:25:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's so many...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.89,0:25:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Well anyway, just a reminder,\Nparty this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.06,0:25:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,With the new frat\Nand sorority members.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.25,0:25:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra, can I skip this one?\NI still have tons of readings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.70,0:25:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.76,0:25:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Duh? Of course not!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.28,0:25:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your party, right?\NYou're one of the new members.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.91,0:25:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.95,0:25:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.25,0:25:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.05,0:25:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to the welcoming party?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.66,0:25:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know. Do we even have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.76,0:25:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good point...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.52,0:26:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time\Nfor these parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.06,0:26:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have three case\Nstudies to review,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.94,0:26:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,four hundred pages of law readings,\Nand an upcoming mock trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.48,0:26:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, but we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.43,0:26:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to survive on this campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.22,0:26:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you're irrelevant.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.83,0:26:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.26,0:26:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Even before I joined this campus,\NI heard a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.93,0:26:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They're seriously powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.06,0:26:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,They can make someone fail,\Neven get a student kicked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.80,0:26:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Or ruin your reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.86,0:26:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Some stories are scary. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.98,0:26:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I still want to be part of it, so\NI'm enduring the initiation process.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.78,0:27:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this was just a simple org.\NThat's how college is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.08,0:27:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,At first, the process was fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.96,0:27:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but now they're making us\Ndo all sorts of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.09,0:27:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I kind of want to quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.38,0:27:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I think about all\Nthe time I've already put in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.71,0:27:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm already here, so I might as\Nwell continue. It's just a sorority.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.66,0:27:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't just a sorority, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.81,0:27:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.31,0:27:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Influence. Protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.56,0:27:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how long\NWhispers has been around?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.34,0:27:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.85,0:27:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,politicians, CEOs, people\Nin the highest positions,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,all of them, almost all of them\Nhave connections to Whispers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.46,0:27:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how much they\Ncan shape our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.66,0:28:15.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.92,0:28:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You sons of bitches!\NWhat do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.45,0:28:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have money!\NYou'll get nothing from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.43,0:28:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.26,0:28:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you! What do you want?\NWho are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.54,0:28:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.43,0:28:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to Whispers!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.79,0:28:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.37,0:29:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I liked you among\Nthe new dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.66,0:29:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're ready to bite all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.40,0:29:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Roar!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.63,0:29:12.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.92,0:29:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- Congrats!\N- Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.22,0:29:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.01,0:29:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.31,0:29:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.06,0:29:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Whose drink is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.03,0:29:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.48,0:29:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Party! Party!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.86,0:29:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw all of you! Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.28,0:29:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw all of you! Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.65,0:30:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.05,0:30:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! Let's party!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.11,0:30:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.46,0:30:40.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers, guys! Everybody, cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.05,0:30:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.28,0:31:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you drag me here?\NAre you drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.94,0:31:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you don't care about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.88,0:31:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.49,0:31:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,For a new member, you're\Npretty brave talking to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.95,0:31:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? How am I supposed\Nto talk to you then?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.00,0:31:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.88,0:31:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.67,0:31:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.22,0:31:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.41,0:31:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem like a good student.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.51,0:31:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Those new members, after class,\Nthey're like animals out of their cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.43,0:31:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They're like wild animals
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.32,0:31:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,who can eat you\Nalive in any way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.70,0:31:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They're smart and dumb\Nat the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.45,0:31:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.44,0:31:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, aren't you one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.53,0:32:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I think about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.62,0:32:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.13,0:32:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I joined because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.98,0:33:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so beautiful, I got confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.52,0:33:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know if I wanted you, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.04,0:33:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,if I wanted to be like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.62,0:33:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was one thing\NI'm sure about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.10,0:33:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to get to know you\Nno matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.81,0:33:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I crazy for wanting\Nyour attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.93,0:33:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.61,0:33:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.17,0:35:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you'll regret this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.78,0:35:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.30,0:35:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If the other members find out,\Nthis will spread around campus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.14,0:35:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay with people\Ntalking about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.85,0:35:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you didn't care\Nwhat others thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.33,0:41:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually really nice here\Nin the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.37,0:41:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.51,0:41:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This used to be my sanctuary.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.71,0:41:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was a kid, I used to hang out here\Nwhenever I wanted some peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.13,0:41:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When I got older, Mama turned it\Ninto a sorority house.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.93,0:42:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So at night, this is where people party.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.02,0:42:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where they drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.15,0:42:11.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Until I eventually\Njoined the Sorority too.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.15,0:42:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.97,0:42:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,this peaceful place became chaotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.63,0:42:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But somehow, I can still\Nfind beauty in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.15,0:42:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so noisy around me, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.03,0:42:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I still haven't\Ngotten used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.54,0:42:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When Mommy and Daddy fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.95,0:43:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,When I don't follow what they want...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.26,0:43:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Even at school...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.11,0:43:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The backstabbers...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.05,0:43:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all just so loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.09,0:43:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,At night, the parties are loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.58,0:43:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so noisy inside my head, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.57,0:43:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's deafening.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.41,0:43:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.67,0:43:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,When it gets too loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.16,0:43:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,cover your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.71,0:43:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Close your eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.72,0:43:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,and take a deep breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.81,0:44:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.37,0:44:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Until all the noise in\Nyour head goes away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.58,0:49:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you thought just because\Nhe approached you,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.46,0:49:03.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my boyfriend wants to\Nflirt with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.53,0:49:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think he was single?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.04,0:49:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know the whole university\Nknows he's my boyfriend, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.69,0:49:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the one who flirted\Nwith me! I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.10,0:49:28.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I really thought it was okay, Sandra.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.54,0:49:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry...\N- Oh, you're talking back now?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.07,0:49:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think\NI am, huh? Stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.30,0:49:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you spend your\Nremaining days on this campus in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.47,0:49:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.28,0:49:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Selene.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.75,0:49:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cass!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.40,0:50:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.84,0:50:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You disappeared from\Nthe party last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.26,0:50:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.84,0:50:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,She got drunk and kept\Nthrowing up, so I took her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.80,0:50:18.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.84,0:50:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I could've taken care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.16,0:50:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You, taking care\Nof someone who's drunk?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.36,0:50:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! I'm super nice now, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.15,0:50:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, anyway, see you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.45,0:50:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.70,0:52:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.07,0:52:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.69,0:52:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.93,0:52:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you always like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.60,0:52:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Selene?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.27,0:52:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She deserves that because\Nshe was flirting with my boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.96,0:52:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it's the other way around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.34,0:53:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys will be guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.81,0:53:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,It's normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.96,0:53:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's not normal\Nare girls who flirt back.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.31,0:53:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that\Nbecause you trust Franco,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.65,0:53:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,or are you just being blind?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.45,0:53:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.18,0:53:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is your last warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.09,0:53:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't call you out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.91,0:53:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If you have a problem,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.62,0:53:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,take it out on Franco.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.25,0:53:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not on other girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.55,0:53:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I don't stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.69,0:53:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna have me voted out?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.57,0:53:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or kicked out, even?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.51,0:53:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because your mom is the\NHead Director of Whispers?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.47,0:53:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.69,0:53:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I tell her
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.89,0:53:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,that her one and only daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.66,0:54:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,is gay as hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.76,0:54:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What would mommy say?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.67,0:55:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Rina?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.84,0:55:10.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what I did wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.24,0:55:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.74,0:55:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.28,0:55:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was drugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.37,0:55:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra set me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.09,0:55:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That night,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.47,0:55:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was drinking alone at a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.80,0:55:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.59,0:55:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Franco's friend approached me,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.65,0:55:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,acted all nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.82,0:56:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He comforted me...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.53,0:56:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.41,0:56:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out it wasn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.23,0:56:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,He spiked my drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.89,0:56:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,After I went to the restroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.19,0:56:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I just blacked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.45,0:56:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.37,0:57:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.97,0:57:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it won't be okay, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.25,0:57:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They already kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.60,0:57:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The university
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.22,0:57:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,already advised me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.02,0:57:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.98,0:57:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.80,0:57:27.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what they're really like, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.36,0:57:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,They hold all the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.87,0:57:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,People like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.88,0:57:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.36,0:57:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not allowed to make mistakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.42,0:57:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're not allowed to fight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.10,0:57:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Because if we do,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.18,0:57:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the punishment is brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.97,0:57:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no other path but to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.80,0:58:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.49,0:58:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.79,0:58:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My little pet coming for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.56,0:58:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You drugged Rina.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.02,0:58:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.90,0:58:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.49,0:58:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Drugged someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.66,0:58:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Cassidy...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.03,0:58:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.95,0:59:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a very serious accusation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.32,0:59:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any evidence or proof
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.19,0:59:12.88,Default,,0,0,0,,to support your claim, Your Honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.56,0:59:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't come at me\Nwith baseless accusations.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.65,0:59:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't win against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.77,0:59:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.03,0:59:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.12,0:59:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.77,0:59:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't stay silent\Nlike everyone else here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.04,0:59:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,At least I did something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.58,0:59:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I stood up to someone like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.88,0:59:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,who thinks she's God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.34,0:59:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.73,0:59:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just rich.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.44,1:00:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have connections.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.43,1:00:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure everyone sees\Nexactly how rotten you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.81,1:00:13.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.47,1:00:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And I hope that when you graduate
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.93,1:00:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,and land on your dream career,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.39,1:00:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll see the way people look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.30,1:00:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks of disgust.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.37,1:00:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because no matter how pretty\Nyou look on the outside,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.09,1:00:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,you're rotting inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.80,1:00:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can fool people
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.04,1:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,but not forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.64,1:00:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.47,1:00:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.00,1:01:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.68,1:01:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.04,1:01:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.20,1:01:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.09,1:01:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You bitch!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.50,1:01:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.98,1:01:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ooh!\N- Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.47,1:01:28.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.73,1:01:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.28,1:01:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[people laughing, murmuring]
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.66,1:01:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!\N- Sandra! Sandra! Drug addict!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.76,1:02:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god! Did you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.95,1:02:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandra wants Cassidy\Nout of the sorority!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! She thinks\Nshe's so tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.09,1:02:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I pity her. She has\Nno idea who she's up against.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.27,1:02:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so brave.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.30,1:02:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.05,1:02:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I get reckless when I'm mad.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.72,1:02:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Anger issues...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.16,1:02:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For years,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.99,1:02:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.58,1:02:35.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.94,1:02:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.77,1:02:43.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even before I became\Na member or student,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.18,1:02:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything because
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.72,1:02:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.35,1:02:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I wasn't the one doing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.11,1:03:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was born into a family\Nof so-called leaders.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.44,1:03:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,They wanted me to be great.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.86,1:03:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And being great means\Nhaving power,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.45,1:03:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter what the cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.26,1:03:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Growing up,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.31,1:03:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I just followed\Nwhat they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.49,1:03:17.84,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't know,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.57,1:03:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to be normal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.03,1:03:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,To
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.65,1:03:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,live a
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.68,1:03:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,quiet and peaceful life.\NThere's no one to please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.54,1:03:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,without being judged.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.31,1:03:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to be\Na regular student.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.33,1:03:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.46,1:04:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to be\Nbrave like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.05,1:04:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.10,1:04:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you be okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.22,1:04:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand me, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.57,1:04:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm ready...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.00,1:04:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When the time comes
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.97,1:04:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that I can defend\Nmyself and others,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.41,1:04:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,that I can stand by\Nwhat we feel.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.80,1:04:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe then, we'll be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.85,1:05:35.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, Cassidy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.31,1:05:39.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.21,1:07:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not show it…
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.51,1:07:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but I care.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.63,1:07:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.54,1:07:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You reminded me of everything I lost\Ntrying to survive in this place.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.51,1:08:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And maybe that's why I kept\Nlooking out for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.53,1:08:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when I wasn't supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.82,1:08:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe, your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.12,1:08:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.83,1:08:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.10,1:09:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.31,1:09:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're under arrest for possession\Nand use of illegal substances.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.06,1:09:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A shocking development tonight\Nas members of the elite sorority
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.32,1:09:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,and fraternity circles of the\Nuniversity, have been arrested
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.59,1:09:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,for drug possession and usage.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.59,1:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Among the arrested is the daughter\Nof Congressman Alfonso Ponce,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.38,1:09:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ms. Sandra Ponce.\N- How dare you! Call my daddy now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.40,1:09:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.69,1:10:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The 2025 Philippine Bar Examinations\Nare currently being administered
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.05,1:10:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,across various universities\Nin the country.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.14,1:10:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Do your best!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.18,1:10:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Our niece...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.01,1:10:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Every day she's working hard,\Nburied in her books, day and night.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.75,1:10:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This has always been her\Ndream, and I know today
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.56,1:10:37.05,Default,,0,0,0,,she's making it come true.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.19,1:10:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is for her.\N- Yes, this is for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.53,1:10:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.91,1:10:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreams...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.79,1:10:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We build them,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.37,1:10:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,break them,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.87,1:10:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and fight for them.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.92,1:10:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But more than dreams
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.85,1:10:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,it's the choices we\Nmake that shape us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.07,1:11:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,To keep going even\Nwhen we're afraid.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.72,1:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when it feels like\Nwe have no one to turn to.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.93,1:11:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when the world tries to silence us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.77,1:11:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Change is always in our hands, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.73,1:11:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
